What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/.../capacity_learning
Date:           September 2026
Contact:        POCO F3 kernel maintainers
Description:
                Read-only FG GEN4 diagnostic snapshot (key=value lines).
                initialized: profile capacity initialization succeeded.
                active: a learning interval is in progress.
                replacement_fallback: the configured replacement was selected.
                successful_updates: successful learning storage callbacks since
                profile initialization or a manual CHARGE_FULL write. Restored
                capacity does not increment this count. Weighted updates are
                not necessarily full charge cycles. This count is not persistent.
                last_error: most recent learning/init/manual-write errno, or 0.
                nominal_uah and learned_uah: algorithm capacities in microamp-hours.
                maximum_uah: active absolute bound; 0 means disabled.
                max_increment_decipct: upward correction limit in decipercent.
                Values are a diagnostic estimate, not battery identification or
                a manufacturer design-capacity specification. Failed multi-step
                hardware writes may leave SRAM and SDAM temporarily inconsistent.
                After a storage failure, learning waits for profile reinitialization.
